# live: join, ready, the summary, then the land grant
wait 240
press fire          # the first table
wait 120
press fire          # ready
until 7E 135 3000   # the summary, the ship landed (FXSH 87h)
xram 3C 4
press fire          # the summary: seen
wait 400
snap g1
xram 3C 4
xram 4D 11
wait 200
snap g2
xram 4D 11
wait 600
snap g3
xram 3C 4
